Y0001 to INV-20868, which marked it paid.\n\nNet result: the vendor was paid $8,297.00 once. The reversed wire (PAY0002) will appear in the payment history. Whoever owns the bank side may want to confirm that PAY0002's reversal went through and that no funds were sent to Borealis twice. The amount was under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no additional approval was needed.", "type": "text"}]}]}